The Plague Codex is a book bearing dark red fire on its cover. It was carried into [[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/Hallia/Hildebrandt Tower|Hildebrandt Tower]] by the people who seized it on [[Phenomena/Bright Souls Eve|Bright Souls Eve]], and thrown from the building before they could take it away. It came down somewhere out in the world, and has not been found.
